WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:07.040
&gt;&gt; THE PRINCIPLE OF ROBB
ELEMENTA SCHOOL IN UVALDE,

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.143
TEXAS, SPEAKING OUT EXCLUSIVELY
TO CNN IN THE AFTERMATH OF A

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:12.712
MASS SHOOTING THAT KILLED 19
CHILDREN AND TWO OF THEIR

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:15.115
TEACHERS.
MANDY GUTIERREZ, WHO HAS BEEN

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:18.718
PUT ON PAID LEAVE, PENDING AN
INVESTIGATION, SAYS SHE STANDS

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:21.688
BY HER ACTIONS ON THAT FATEFUL
DAY AND THAT SHE FOLLOWED HER

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:24.090
TRAINING.
SHE ALSO SAYS THAT ACCUSATION

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:27.694
SHE WAS LAX ABOUT SCHOOL
SECURITY ARE UNFAIR AND

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:29.729
INACCURATE.
MORE TONIGHT FROM CNN'S ROSA

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:36.102
FLORES.
&gt;&gt; WHEN I WAS CALLING CHIEF

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:43.309
ARREDONDO, I HEARD THREE SHOTS.
THE INITIAL THREE SHOTS.

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:46.212
&gt;&gt; THE PRINCIPLE OF ROBB
ELEMENTARY SCHOOL IN UVALDE

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.948
BREAKING HER SILENCE AND
ANSWERING QUESTIONS ABOUT

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:51.784
ALLEGATIONS OF LAX SECURITY AT
THE SCHOOL.

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:55.388
&gt;&gt; I BELIEVE THAT I DID MY JOB
TO THE BEST OF MY ABILITIES.

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:59.159
&gt;&gt; WHILE ON FORSMAN'S HANDLING
OF THAT ILL-FATED DAY HAS SEEN

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:03.296
THE MOST SCRUTINY UP TO NOW,
THE FAMILIES OF THE VICTIMS --

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:06.766
&gt;&gt; THEY DON'T GIVE A DARN ABOUT
OUR CHILDREN OR US.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:11.971
&gt;&gt; TURNING THEIR CARLES FOR
ACCOUNTABILITY TOWARDS THE

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:15.475
SCHOOL ADMINISTRATION,
INCLUDING THE SCHOOL PRINCIPAL,

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:18.377
WHO SAYS SHE WAS SUSPENDED WITH
PAY THIS, WEEK PENDING A FOR

00:01:18.377 --> 00:01:20.413
PERFORMANCE REVIEW RELATING TO
CAMPUS SECURITY.

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:23.983
LAST SCHOOL YEAR WAS HER FIRST
SCHOOLYARD'S PRINCIPLE.

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:28.588
&gt;&gt; EVERY --
STARTING AT THAT SCHOOL,

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:30.156
[INAUDIBLE]
NEEDS TO BE GONE.

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:32.091
ALL OF THE SCHOOL BOARD MEETS
BEGUN.

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:34.293
&gt;&gt; I BELIEVE THEY ARE ENTITLED
TO THEIR OPINION.

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:39.999
I FOLLOWED THE TRAINING THAT I
WAS PROVIDED WITH, TO THE BEST

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.635
OF MY ABILITIES.
&gt;&gt; THE TEXAS HOUSE

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:45.071
INVESTIGATIVE COMMITTEE REPORT
REVEALED THAT ROBB ELEMENTARY

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:49.008
HAD A CULTURE OF NONCOMPLIANCE
WITH SAFETY POLICIES, REQUIRING

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:52.879
DOORS TO BE KEPT LOCKED, WHICH
TURNED OUT TO BE FATAL.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:55.148
GUTIERREZ RESPONDING TO THAT
CRITICISM --

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:58.851
&gt;&gt; WAS THERE A CULTURE OF
NONCOMPLIANCE AT ROBB

00:01:58.851 --> 00:01:59.886
ELEMENTARY?
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY NOT.

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:06.392
ANY TIME THAT AN ALERT WENT OUT,
ANY EVERY SINGLE TEACHER AROUND

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:10.496
THAT CAMPUS TO TOOK IT TO MEAN
IT COULD BE A POTENTIAL

00:02:10.496 --> 00:02:15.168
ESCALATING SITUATION.
AND SO EVERYBODY FOLLOWS

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:18.137
PROTOCOL.
&gt;&gt; SO, YOU DISAGREE WITH THE

00:02:18.137 --> 00:02:20.173
FINDINGS OF THE TEXAS HOUSE
INVESTIGATIVE REPORT?

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:22.875
&gt;&gt; I DISAGREE.
&gt;&gt; ACCORDING TO THE TEXAS HOUSE

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:25.378
INVESTIGATIVE REPORT, A COACH
THAT WAS SOMEWHERE ON SCHOOL

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:27.647
PROPERTY, SAW THE GUNMAN JUMPED
THIS FENCE.

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:29.482
SHE USED HER RADIO TO REPORT
IT.

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:33.052
THE PRINCIPAL HEARD THE CALL
AND TRIED TO INITIATE A

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:37.223
LOCKDOWN USING A SOFTWARE
APPLICATION BUT THE WI-FI WAS

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:40.260
BAD AND SHE DID NOT USE THE
SCHOOL INTERCOM.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.562
&gt;&gt; THEY COULD POTENTIALLY
MAGNIFY A SITUATION.

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:46.866
&gt;&gt; THAT'S THE DOOR THAT THE
GUNMAN USED TO ENTER THE SCHOOL,

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:48.301
ACCORDING TO THE REPORT, THE
DOOR WAS UNLOCKED.

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:52.138
HAD THE DOOR BEEN LOCKED, AS
THE POLICY REQUIRED, IT WOULD

00:02:52.138 --> 00:02:53.706
HAVE LIKELY SLOWED DOWN THE
GUNMAN.

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:57.310
INSTEAD, SURVEILLANCE VIDEO
SHOWED THE GUNMAN WALKED INTO

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:59.579
THE BUILDING THROUGH AN
UNLOCKED DOOR.

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:01.681
WHY WAS THAT DOOR UNLOCKED THAT
DAY?

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:04.617
&gt;&gt; I AM NOT SURE WHY THAT DOOR
WAS UNLOCKED.

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:07.620
&gt;&gt; SO, THAT DOOR WAS NORMALLY
LOCKED DURING THE DAY?

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.756
&gt;&gt; ALWAYS LOCKED.
&gt;&gt; ALWAYS?

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:12.292
&gt;&gt; YES.
&gt;&gt; THEN, WALKED INTO A

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:15.128
CLASSROOM, WHICH WAS LIKELY
UNLOCKED, ACCORDING TO THE

00:03:15.128 --> 00:03:17.897
REPORT.
THE REPORT ALSO STATES THAT THE

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:21.868
PRINCIPAL, TEACHERS AND EVEN
MANY FOURTH GRADE STUDENTS

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:24.170
WIDELY KNEW OF THE PROBLEM WITH
A LOCK TO ROOM 111.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:27.373
BUT NO ONE PLACE TO WORK ORDER
TO REPAIR THE LOCK --

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:30.343
NOT THE PRINCIPLE, NOT ANYONE
ELSE.

00:03:30.343 --> 00:03:32.679
GUTIERREZ DISPUTES THAT
ACCOUNT.

00:03:32.679 --> 00:03:38.217
&gt;&gt; WOULD I KNOW FOR A FACT IS
THAT THE DOOR TO ROOM 111 DID,

00:03:38.217 --> 00:03:40.119
IN FACT, LOCK.
&gt;&gt; IT DID?

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:42.255
&gt;&gt; THE TEACHER HAS TO USE THE
KEY TO ENTER.

00:03:42.255 --> 00:03:48.027
&gt;&gt; SO, SOMEHOW, THE REPORT SAYS
THAT IT WAS LIKELY UNLOCKED.

00:03:48.027 --> 00:03:53.299
SO, SOMEHOW, IT COULD HAVE BEEN
UNLOCKED ON THAT TODAY.

00:03:53.299 --> 00:03:56.869
&gt;&gt; IT'S POSSIBLE.
&gt;&gt; SOME OF THE FAMILIES OF THE

00:03:56.869 --> 00:04:01.107
VICTIMS SAY, ANY SAFETY LAPSES
WERE INEXCUSABLE.

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:07.213
&gt;&gt; WHAT DID YOU TELL HER?
&gt;&gt; WE FAILED OUR CHILDREN.

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:09.215
YOU FAILED OUR CHILDREN.
&gt;&gt; [INAUDIBLE]

00:04:09.215 --> 00:04:13.052
CLOSE TO MY STAFF.
AND MY STUDENTS.

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:22.462
AND MANY OF THEIR FAMILIES.
IT'S AN UNIMAGINABLE PAIN, TO

00:04:22.462 --> 00:04:25.765
KNOW THAT WE DON'T HAVE THOSE
INDIVIDUALS WITH US ANYMORE.

00:04:25.765 --> 00:04:28.368
THOSE FAMILIES THAT ARE MISSING
THEIR LOVED ONES, EVERY SINGLE

00:04:28.368 --> 00:04:30.470
DAY.
&gt;&gt; THE TEXAS HOUSE

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:33.406
INVESTIGATIVE COMMITTEE
STANDING BY THEIR REPORT, THE

00:04:33.406 --> 00:04:36.776
CHAIRMAN ISSUING A STATEMENT TO
CNN, SAYING, THAT THAT IS BASED

00:04:36.776 --> 00:04:40.213
ON TESTIMONY FROM MULTIPLE
INDIVIDUALS, FROM MULTIPLE

00:04:40.213 --> 00:04:42.448
AGENCIES.
AS FOR THE SCHOOL DISTRICT, A

00:04:42.448 --> 00:04:44.717
SPOKES PERSON DID RESPOND TO
OUR REQUEST FOR COMMENT.

00:04:44.717 --> 00:04:47.153
BUT SAID THAT THEY ARE TOO SWAMPED
TO ANSWER QUESTIONS.

